    "turn_idx": 100,
    "turn_text": "Well, it's just been an absolute honor and a privilege for me to serve the people of Louisiana and hopefully the people of the United States. Being in the Congress has afforded me and my family, Diane's especially, to meet people that we would have never met to do things we would have never done, to go places that we would have never gone, and to help people that we would have never known before. So, you know, you put it all in a little ball and you look through the crystal ball, so to speak, and these last six years that I've been in Congress. have been wonderful. And I, you know, I'm just, again, I appreciate and I'm very thankful to the people of the fifth district for putting me in that position, elected me to that office.",
